theorem J_mul_J (p q : ℕ) : Formalism.UG.Jpq p q * Formalism.UG.Jpq p q = 1 := by
  simp [Formalism.UG.Jpq, Matrix.fromBlocks_multiply]

/- English proof (translation)
Simplify using the standard rewrite rules.
-/
theorem J_conjTranspose (p q : ℕ) : (Formalism.UG.Jpq p q)ᴴ = Formalism.UG.Jpq p q := by
  simp [Formalism.UG.Jpq, Matrix.fromBlocks_conjTranspose]

/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. By extensionality, compare the relevant components. Apply the first step, then apply the next step to every resulting obligation. Simplify using the standard rewrite rules. Apply the first step, then apply the next step to every resulting obligation.

Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Prove the components needed by the constructor for the conclusion. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. By extensionality, compare the relevant components. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

