Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Reduce the claim to the hypotheses of an applicable result. Chain the equalities or inequalities of the calculation. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations.

